                        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding-left: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                            Why Choose an SEO Freelancer Instead of an Agency in Dubai?
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            Both agencies and freelancers can deliver results, but they work very differently. Many business owners in Dubai choose a freelancer for distinct operational advantages:
                        </p>
                        <ul class="kdm-bullet-list" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <li><strong>Direct access to the expert:</strong> With a freelancer, the person you speak to on the first call is the person doing the work. There is no confusion between sales teams and execution teams.</li>
                            <li><strong>Faster decisions and communication:</strong> Freelancers can respond quickly, adjust plans without long approval chains and adapt to changes in your business.</li>
                            <li><strong>More cost-effective pricing:</strong> Agencies carry high overheads such as luxury office leases and account management layers. A freelancer offers comparable seniority at flexible pricing.</li>
                            <li><strong>Personal attention and accountability:</strong> Your project is not one of hundreds handled by a rotating staff. A senior freelancer's reputation depends on every client.</li>
                            <li><strong>Flexibility in engagement:</strong> Tailor your partnership for a one-time audit, monthly retainer, website rebuild with SEO, or complete growth funnel.</li>
